  "description": "EQIKEW crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/m. Reported CIF formula moiety: C77 H90 Cr4 Dy4 F4 N4 O28,1.75(C1 H4 O1),0.5(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Cr1 (Cr) has 5 O neighbors; Cr2 (Cr) has 5 O neighbors; Cr3 (Cr) has 5 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy6 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Cr7 (Cr) has 5 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Cr4 (Cr) has 5 O neighbors; Cr5 (Cr) has 5 O neighbors; Cr6 (Cr) has 5 O neighbors; Dy7 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy8 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Cr8 (Cr) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 24 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.302-3.913 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 96.61-107.48°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C77H90Cr4Dy4F4N4O28·1.75MeOH·0.5H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)). Article name explicitly identifies Cr(III), Dy(III).",
